],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"7c8cce92\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":50,\"width\":{\"size\":50,\"unit\":\"%\"},\"column_sticky_offset\":50,\"scroll_y\":-80,\"width_tablet\":{\"size\":100,\"unit\":\"%\"},\"content_width\":\"full\",\"container_sticky_offset\":50},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"24c8b9d9\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/localhost:10003\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/12\\/Retina.jpg\",\"id\":\"8870\",\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"alignment\":\"center\",\"scroll_y\":-80},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"wd_image_or_svg\"}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"535849ae\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_gap\":{\"size\":null,\"column\":\"\",\"row\":\"\",\"unit\":\"px\",\"isLinked\":true},\"container_sticky_offset\":50,\"scroll_y\":-80},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"4df6ea36\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"subtitle\":\"\",\"title\":\"macOS Monterey\",\"after_title\":\"\",\"size\":\"small\",\"align\":\"left\",\"scroll_y\":-80},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"wd_title\"},{\"id\":\"2929b016\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"text\":\"<p>The power of the Apple processor in combination with an advanced operating system opens up all the advantages of the device for professionals. Now you can use one input device to work simultaneously on your Mac and iPad \\u2014 with Universal Control. Automate complex tasks using Quick Commands. Share images from your screen, watch movies together, and work on projects over FaceTime. And the focus mode will help you concentrate by temporarily turning off unnecessary messages.<\\/p>\",\"scroll_y\":-80},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"wd_text_block\"},{\"id\":\"132c02de\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"width\":{\"size\":null,\"unit\":\"%\"},\"column_sticky_offset\":50,\"scroll_y\":-80,\"content_width\":\"full\",\"flex_direction\":\"row\",\"flex_direction_mobile\":\"column-reverse\",\"flex_align_items\