INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (11284,1,'2026-03-08 06:12:45','2026-03-08 06:12:45',' 						 					\n																					<img width=\"1420\" height=\"480\" src=\"http://localhost:10003/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/broadway-store-l-opt.jpg\" alt=\"\" />																		\n								1260 Broadway, San Francisco, CA 94109							\n													<h4 data-elementor-setting-key=\"title\">\n								Broadway Store							</h4>\n									<a href=\"#\" aria-label=\"Banner link\"></a>\n						 						 					\n						 					\n				<h4>Address</h4> \n						 					<ul>\n											<li>\n											<img src=\"http://localhost:10003/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/map-point.svg\" title=\"map-point\" width=\"36\" height=\"36\">					\n						1260 Broadway, San Francisco, CA 94109					\n									</li>\n											<li>\n											<img src=\"http://localhost:10003/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/phone-1.svg\" title=\"phone\" width=\"36\" height=\"36\">					\n						(208) 555-0112					\n									</li>\n					</ul>\n			<a href=\"#\">\n					Store				\n						<img src=\"http://localhost:10003/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/cart.svg\" title=\"cart\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\">					\n							</a>\n			<a href=\"#\">\n					Point delivery				\n						<img src=\"http://localhost:10003/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/shop-1.svg\" title=\"shop\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\">					\n							</a>\n			<a href=\"#\">\n					Service center				\n						<img src=\"http://localhost:10003/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/cog-1.svg\" title=\"cog\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\">					\n							</a>\n						 					\n			<p>Then I feel the presence of the Almighty, who formed us in his own image, and the breath of that universal love.</p><p>Overspreads my eyes, and heaven and earth seem.</p><p><a style=\"color: #1877f2\" href=\"#\"><em>Get Help</em></a></p><p>Then I feel the presence of the Almighty, who formed us in his own image, and the breath of that universal love. It\'s content strategy gone awry right from the start.</p>\n				<h4>Hours</h4> \n						 					\n			<t